ce_tag":"_t","target":"现在你应该知道，这八个 #GOLD#战斗属性#WHITE# 的含义和使用时机了。现在来看一些数字计算。\n\n向北前进，从楼梯进入 #GOLD#冒险者启蒙地下城#WHITE#。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a4239c170e46c6112323f717ac5a8a2da30677a195c98424fdf509bf06ffbf88","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0f861b9ac80016eb5a465723ad34b9fed20df17a74ba5fde641a4019fed4c6a5","logical_entry_identity":"9cc90c4afff2f4d608be2a42b76beffb0be299aaec3165da13f873da50eaf5da","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Distorted Animated Sword","source_tag":"entity name","target":"极·次元之刃"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"337633dd21d3047988a082512df0221242d3b860f64ebf3e7e1eab3d426f2ca8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0f89cb419033d86902b5656906edcdbdf8d6607dca55067309783f92c5316e5e","logical_entry_identity":"e2e824ecf8f2c7dc995fcab39f33513cc9d308c14fe841314a967286dc6f22f3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"battered skull","source_tag":"_t","target":"破损的头骨"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4f4b1b80e469a3417ce38c90366a75af39b94ffe6a65f4b95470d13affcc056c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0f8a50107008eabcdb288a644bd797959d2e875a712d714ba15eb3a6a56887b5","logical_entry_identity":"cccfc86c95db7c2ef9a5fe6de73ecf0b43cc09df6799aaa365244721240573e6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This place is infested! I've found a lot of skeletons now, and unfortunately most of them have borne a full set of limbs. However, my holy quest cannot be denied! Plus I got a really great sword off one of the blighters, I can chop anything up easily now!\n\nThe skeletal mages have been a night-born nuisance, but I've found a new weapon to use against them - a phase door rune! As soon as I catch sight of one of the robed wretches I activate my rune and foom, I'm away!\n\nIt's not fleeing, it's just tactical repositioning...\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"这里到处都是怪物！我发现了一大堆的骷髅，不幸的是它们大多都四肢齐全。即便如此，我的神圣使命也不容阻挡！顺带一提，我从一只怪物那得来一把极好的剑，有了这把好剑，我现在砍什么都轻而易举！\n\n这些骷髅法师真是一群黑夜孳生的麻烦精，但我已经发现了一种新式武器对付他们——一块相位门符文！只要我一看见其中一个穿袍子的混蛋，我就启动符文，呼的一声，我就没影了！\n\n这可不是逃跑，这只是战术性调整站位……\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"99ada7c98edb1f1a135773533aa2a5dbc5b5a31241d6ed21b40d9f55c3cf1e77","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0f8b2823957611c9680919f292f6b02b5e1bfb7e3cd72b95c7c9967cd645c880","logical_entry_identity":"ada92514db07c7ac2227eb1aa0bcae779b833f6164fc374969cbc7dd731d414f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Shroud foes within radius %d in darkest light, dealing %0.2f light and %0.2f darkness damage per turn and converting %d%% of the damage they deal between light and darkness for %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用至暗之光笼罩半径 %d 范围内的所有敌人，每回合对其造成 %0.2f 光系和 %0.2f 暗影伤害，并使它们所造成伤害的 %d%% 在光系与暗影之间转换，持续 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"057bee4374611d7b2abdb607903472a244bb3eb23f7259838f7ac3803b3dac3c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0f933f3c8ba5b8c63d5ad71bae0cba5a57526aed73b89d1e4991b5fda2ea8619","logical_entry_identity":"a519a5a73d236ae20b7854a38392218ca365139ae25f34cfa03e8b1e4137e8d1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Source# emits dark energies at your feet.","source_tag":"logCombat","target":"#Source#朝你脚下喷吐黑暗能量。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"131636e07c46f25705981e401666e388036f5a546252f0848b52641c71a504ef","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0f9619506bd5d1ac31cc7b1ae9dc54ee60b592d455c191563c928f559926f2af","logical_entry_identity":"975e3c448270ae2b25f43280de38fc3dde976050b394281060cbe8ab4d01297f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"vitalizing ","source_tag":"entity name","target":"活力的"},{"args_order":[2,1,3,4,5],"call_locator":"addfc464980a1e80668d7410bd70163d3e25136bcfd0f8c1e877e4d28e62d71c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"699cf0710e1f1ed00460290d018db54cf62e3f3e5129c22ac8ea840561b65b29","logical_entry_identity":"0c3076a9d322ca8b682d5f4e05db974c76e0cc0aa953801fea70eccf0177481c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Command your Temporal Hounds to breathe time, dealing %0.2f temporal damage and reducing the three highest stats of all targets in a radius %d cone.\n\t\tAffected targets will have their stats reduced by %d for %d turns.  You are immune to the breath of your own hounds and your hounds are immune to stat damage from other hounds.\n\t\tWhen you learn this talent, your hounds gain %d%% temporal damage affinity.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"命令猎犬们使用时光吐息，对半径 %d 的锥形范围内所有目标造成 %0.2f 点时空伤害，并使其三项最高属性降低 %d 点，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t你免疫自己猎犬的吐息。自己的猎犬免疫其他猎犬的属性降低效果。\n\t\t当你学会该技能后，猎犬们获得 %d%% 时空伤害亲和。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}